  "decisions": [
    "OpenVINO is an optional Intel inference provider; its official GPU device scope is Intel GPU.",
    "OpenVINO contrib NVIDIA support remains experimental and separately admitted, not the production default.",
    "ONNX is the primary open interchange when supported; direct export from the original model source is preferred.",
    "ONNX Runtime is the provider-neutral execution-provider host; plugin ABI integration is preferred when available.",
    "TensorRT is an optional primary optimized NVIDIA inference backend; TensorRT-RTX is a conditional RTX-specific candidate.",
    "Engine/timing caches are derived disposable artifacts and are invalidated on compatibility fingerprint drift.",
    "All provider versions and driver/CUDA/backend combinations require immutable pins, support-matrix admission and current-host evidence."
  ]
